  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Barb Wire is an ultra-performance shaped co-polyester designed primarily for maximum spin and ball bite. Its spin-coiled, sharp-edged profile grips the ball felt to create heavy rotation while allowing players to swing aggressively through the ball. Unlike some spin strings that rely heavily on stiffness, Barb Wire derives much of its spin from its geometry, helping it provide a surprisingly comfortable response while maintaining strong power and all-around playability.",

    "zh": "Solinco Barb Wire 是一款以极致旋转和咬球为核心的高性能异形共聚酯球线。其 Spin-Coiled 缠绕式轮廓与锐利边缘能够更强地抓住网球毛毡，从而制造大量旋转，让球员可以更大胆地完整加速挥拍。它的旋转并不主要依赖极高硬度，而更多来自球线本身的异形结构，因此在高旋转聚酯线中能够提供相对出色的舒适性，同时保持力量和全场可打性。"
  },

